# suite-state — per-suite lifecycle state for this repository.
#
# One line per suite that is not in the default (active) state.
# Format: <suite> | <state> | <since UTC> | <bead> | <reason>
#
# States
#   active       default; not stored here — a suite absent from this file is active.
#   quarantined  runs everywhere; a red does not block the queue; bead is required.
#   disabled     not run; recorded as skip in every pass.
#
# This file is read from the TREE UNDER TEST, not from the installed harness,
# so testenv-batch.sh, CI and the hourly run each judge the tree they carry.
# Transitions are written by: testenv suites quarantine [--until <UTC>] | unquarantine | disable | activate.
# A quarantine ends at its `until=<UTC>` (appended to the bead column), else SPIRA_QUARANTINE_MAX_AGE after since.
